## Expectations

This website helps connect commission-ready buyers with Jonathan “Benjo” Manigo. Inquiries are reviewed and qualified before Benjo quotes price and timeline. Jon may earn a referral commission when a sale starts through a **first contact on this website** — rate and terms are agreed separately between Jon and Benjo.

The site is built as a partnership: no upfront website fee; Jon earns when the website helps generate business.

## Privacy

Information you submit is used only to respond to your commission inquiry. It is not sold to third parties.
